    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "THE WORLDS FASTEST AND LARGEST JETLINER\nTWA\nS033\nNTERCONTINENTAL\nTWA BOEING 707",
      "TWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES, INC.\nU.S.A. • EUROPE • AFRICA • ASIA\n380 MADISON AVENUE\nhave\nMay\nron\n• NEW YORK 17 • NEW YORK • U.S. A.\nNOV 1 8 1959\npeen\nNovember 12, 1959\nHere is the advance story on\nTWA's newest Jet service....\nWithin \u0026 few days, you will be able to fly non-stop from\nNew York to Europe on the newest, fastest and largest jet-\nliner in the world...non-stop to London or Paris and non-\nstop on the return flight across the Atlantic.\nThis brochure tells the story...about the wonderful new\nplane which makes this possible and about the delightful\nexperiences a flight aboard this plane will be. Service to\nLondon and Frankfurt starts November 23...shortly thereafter\nto Paris and Rome.\nNo matter where you start your trip, from any point in the\nU.S.A., TWA's new jet service will cut many valuable hours\nfrom your travel time.\nWe look forward to welcoming you aboard soon.\nCordially,\nLe Marchal\nLouis P. Marechal\nVice-President and\nGeneral Sales Manager\n2001.039.204L",
      "200.0260\nTHE WORLD'S FASTEST AND LARGEST JETLINER\nTWA\nINTERCONTINENTAL\nTWA BORING TOT\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES, INC.\nU.S.A. • EUROPE • AFRICA • ASIA\n380 MADISON AVENUE\nI have\n•NEW YORK 17 • NEW YORK • U.S.A.\npayi\nroun\nJA NOV 1 8 1959\nзаму\nNovember 12, 1959\nHere is the advance story on\nTWA's newest Jet service....\nWithin a few days, you will be able to fly non-stop from\nNew York to Europe on the newest, fastest and largest jet-\nliner in the world...non-stop to London or Paris and non-\nstop on the return flight across the Atlantic.\nThis brochure tells the story...about the wonderful new\nplane which makes this possible and about the delightful\nexperiences a flight aboard this plane will be.\nService to\nLondon and Frankfurt starts November 23...shortly thereafter\nto Parie and Rome.\nNo matter where you start your trip, from any point in the\nU.S.A., TWA's new jet service will cut many valuable hours\nfrom your travel time.\nWe look forward to welcoming you aboard soon.\nI prechal\nVice-President and\nGeneral Sales Manager\n2.001.034",
      "TWA\nWORLD AIRLINES\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nLitho in U.S.A."
    ],
